Mplus VERSION 9 DEMO (Mac)
MUTHEN & MUTHEN
10/19/2026   9:57 PM

INPUT INSTRUCTIONS

  TITLE: fitLCGA (linear, K = 3) vs Mplus 9 DEMO, TYPE = MIXTURE, ESTIMATOR = ML;
    class-specific residual variance, equal across the 5 waves (Carm LCGA);
  DATA: FILE IS lcga.dat;
  VARIABLE:
    NAMES ARE y0-y4;
    CLASSES = c(3);
  ANALYSIS:
    TYPE = MIXTURE;
    ESTIMATOR = ML;
    STARTS = 400 100;
    STITERATIONS = 50;
    MCONVERGENCE = 0.000001;
    LOGCRITERION = 0.0000001;
    RLOGCRITERION = 0.0000000001;
    PROCESSORS = 1;
  MODEL:
    %OVERALL%
    i s | y0@0 y1@1 y2@2 y3@3 y4@4;
    i@0; s@0; i WITH s@0;
    %c#1%
    [i s];
    y0-y4 (r1);
    %c#2%
    [i s];
    y0-y4 (r2);
    %c#3%
    [i s];
    y0-y4 (r3);
  OUTPUT: TECH1;



